opencc
------------------------------------------
Open Chinese Convert (OpenCC) is an opensource project for conversion between
Traditional Chinese and Simplified Chinese, supporting character-level
conversion, phrase-level conversion, variant conversion and regional idioms
among Mainland China, Taiwan and Hong kong.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libmarisa0-0.2.7-1
  libopencc-devel-1.4.2-1bl1
  libopencc1.4-1.4.2-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libbenchmark-devel-1.10.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libmarisa-devel-0.2.7-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  rapidjson-devel-1.1.0p577-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC/archive/refs/tags/ver.1.4.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack opencc-1.4.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./opencc-1.4.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/opencc-1.4.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/opencc-1.4.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libopencc1.4-1.4.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libopencc-devel-1.4.2-X.tar.xz

